  IconPath: icons/magic/symbols/runes-carved-stone-green.webp
  Description: You know the Wildsong, a secret language known only within druid orders,
    in addition to any languages you know through your ancestry. The Wildsong is
    a melodic and tonal language sounding more like animal calls than a spoken tongue,
    and its alphabet involves fractals and spirals, like the arrangement of a seashell's
    chambers, a snowflake's crystals, or a fern's fronds. Teaching the Wildsong to
    non-druids is anathema.
